  "details": "Please update the terms of service section 8.10 to include age and date of birth.\n\nWe now have a working solution to age verification and whether instance owners agree or not, a persons age and date of birth should no longer be something a user is required to disclose. This should be included with the anti-doxing language that already includes name, address, and government id.\n\nNobody should be allowed to require the disclosure of ANY personally identifiable information and should solely be relying on the in-game mechanism already provided by vrchat.",
